      "id": "91cc60ee-ccd5-4c1c-a3e5-86d9747c743e",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-26T08:51:00Z",
      "level": "info",
      "message": "## Summary\n\nImplemented the Customers page feature (DS-04): new `src/Customers.js` component with 12 mock customer rows, client-side text search with pagination (5 per page), and a Customers nav link in Sidebar. Added corresponding CSS in `App.css` and comprehensive tests in `src/Customers.test.js`. All existing tests continue to pass and the production build succeeds.\n\n## Plan Steps Completed\n\n- Created `src/Customers.js` \u2014 functional component with `mockCustomers` (12 entries), `useState` for search/page, `useEffect` for search-resets-pagination, `useMemo` for filtered list, pagination slice (pageSize=5), Previous/Next buttons with page indicator\n- Modified `src/Sidebar.js` \u2014 added `{ label: \"Customers\", path: \"/customers\", icon: \"fa-solid fa-users\" }` to navItems\n- Modified `src/App.js` \u2014 added `import Customers` and `<Route path=\"/customers\">` behind auth guard\n- Modified `src/App.css` \u2014 added `.customers-container`, `.customers-title`, `.customers-pagination`, `.customers-page-btn`, `.customers-page-btn--disabled`, `.customers-page-info` styles\n- Created `src/Customers.test.js` \u2014 6 tests: smoke, renders rows, case-insensitive search, no-results message, pagination controls, search resets page\n- Modified `docs/ai/context-map.json` \u2014 appended `\"/customers\"` to `knownPaths`\n- Validated: `npm test` (14/14 pass), `npm run build` (success)\n\n## Files Changed\n\n- `src/Customers.js` \u2014 new file: 12-entry mock table with search + pagination (sidebar layout)\n- `src/Customers.test.js` \u2014 new file: 6 tests following Orders.test.js pattern\n- `src/Sidebar.js` \u2014 added Customers nav item to `navItems` array\n- `src/App.js` \u2014 added import and `/customers` Route alongside `/orders`\n- `src/App.css` \u2014 added customers container, title, pagination bar, button, and page info styles\n- `docs/ai/context-map.json` \u2014 added `\"/customers\"` to `knownPaths`\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npm test -- --watchAll=false` \u2014 3 suites, 14 tests passed (all existing + 6 new Customers tests)\n- `npm run build` \u2014 compiled successfully (111 kB JS, 2.2 kB CSS gzipped)\n\n## Risks\n\n- Zero-results search shows \"Page 1 of 1\" (guarded via `displayTotal || 1`) \u2014 acceptable per spec\n- Pagination bar is hidden when filtered result is empty (only shows \"No customers found\" message) \u2014 matches Orders pattern behavior\n- No backend/data dependency \u2014 all mock data inline",
      "stepKey": "code_implementer"
    },
